        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-08-panel-06",
        "text": "A dead prisoner cannot",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          161,
          482,
          539,
          530
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-08-panel-06",
        "text": "testify.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          161,
          540,
          270,
          588
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-01",
        "text": "I closed my eyes. Not in prayer. In calculation.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          888,
          217,
          1587,
          262
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-02",
        "text": "How many guards. How often they changed. Which men wore keys and which carried only cudgels. How many steps from the stair to the",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          42,
          39,
          1982,
          81
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-02",
        "text": "courtyard.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          42,
          91,
          188,
          133
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-03",
        "text": "They are gathering us for transport.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          1211,
          182,
          1729,
          225
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-03",
        "text": "South. By ship. For labour.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          1211,
          235,
          1595,
          278
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-04",
        "text": "Ships meant movement.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          60,
          149,
          377,
          188
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-04",
        "text": "Movement meant chances.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          60,
          197,
          414,
          228
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-04",
        "text": "They had taken my name. They",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          60,
          344,
          466,
          383
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-04",
        "text": "had tried to break my body.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          60,
          392,
          422,
          431
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-04",
        "text": "They had forgotten the simplest lesson of",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          60,
          688,
          602,
          727
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-04",
        "text": "the Deccan monsoon.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          60,
          735,
          343,
          766
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      },
      {
        "frame_id": "page-09-panel-04",
        "text": "Storms do not ask permission.",
        "source_pixel_rect": [
          1230,
          711,
          1632,
          751
        ],
        "light_fraction": 1.0
      }
    ]
  },
